fcitx5-shadowbar (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Popup-only clipboard monitoring & local model idle auto-unload:
    - Limit Wayland/X11 background clipboard subscriptions to active popup display
    - Auto-unload local Hunyuan HY-MT1.5 llama-server after configurable idle timeout
    - Add `--wake-ty` on-demand wake support and single-slot KV optimization (`-np 1`)
  * Floating UI modernization & theme polish:
    - Reorganized card header chrome and dedicated language/preset control bar
    - Corrected model labels to Hunyuan HY-MT1.5 across UI and documentation
    - Adaptive light/dark/accent system theme following and opaque dropdown/menu popups

 -- ang <ang-XWBWZ@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:20:00 -0500

fcitx5-shadowbar (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public non-commercial open-source release:
    - ShadowBar Fcitx5 addon & virtual IM (`libshadowbar.so`, `libshadowbarim.so`)
    - Qt6 floating translation UI (`shadowbar-float`) with Wayland/X11 background clipboard watch & file/link avoidance
    - 20-language unified translation routing & `shadowbar-sim` interactive CLI simulator
    - Multi-format offline dictionary engine (ECDICT SQLite/CSV, StarDict, CC-CEDICT, JSON/JSONL, TSV)
    - Hunyuan HY-MT1.5-1.8B (1.25bit / 2bit GGUF) local model manager with Vulkan/CPU fallback
    - Built-in One-Click Chinese Environment & IME Fixer (Arch, Debian/Ubuntu, Fedora, openSUSE)

 -- ang <ang-XWBWZ@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:59:00 -0500
